          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Mahboub, from Maalik Bin Atiyya, from Abu Baseer, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> regarding a woman who slandered a man. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘She would be whipped eighty lashes’."
